        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only Up: Snow</strong> is a demanding single-player parkour adventure where every step, jump, and climb matters. Designed to test your patience, focus, and agility, this game challenges you to rise higher and higher — with nothing but your determination keeping you from falling back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin your journey in a snowy, frozen landscape, surrounded by ice and silence. But the climb doesn’t stop there. As you progress, the world changes — from slippery, snow-covered areas to towering skyscrapers, narrow ledges, and unstable platforms high above the city. The higher you go, the greater the risk, and the more satisfying every step forward becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/768411dd42c3f598fcb8e67828c74df2.poster.avif?t=1776602236\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/768411dd42c3f598fcb8e67828c74df2.webm?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/768411dd42c3f598fcb8e67828c74df2.mp4?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake has consequences. One wrong move can undo minutes — or even hours — of progress. There are no checkpoints to save you, no shortcuts to the top. All you have is your skill, your timing, and your determination to reach the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/6e26bce25fe96fbcb2261d9858fef5b6.poster.avif?t=1776602236\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/6e26bce25fe96fbcb2261d9858fef5b6.webm?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/6e26bce25fe96fbcb2261d9858fef5b6.mp4?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Single-Player Parkour</strong> – A true test of patience, reflexes, and consistency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Beginning</strong> – Start your climb in a frozen, icy environment that sets the tone for the journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> – Progress from snowy landscapes into massive skyscrapers and tricky city structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Gameplay</strong> – Every fall sends you back to the beginning, making every move intense and meaningful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Journey</strong> – Feel the shift from cold silence to dizzying heights as you climb higher and higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> – Each attempt teaches you new paths, tricks, and strategies to climb faster and further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the summit, or will the climb defeat you?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only Up: Snow</strong> is a demanding single-player parkour adventure where every step, jump, and climb matters. Designed to test your patience, focus, and agility, this game challenges you to rise higher and higher — with nothing but your determination keeping you from falling back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin your journey in a snowy, frozen landscape, surrounded by ice and silence. But the climb doesn’t stop there. As you progress, the world changes — from slippery, snow-covered areas to towering skyscrapers, narrow ledges, and unstable platforms high above the city. The higher you go, the greater the risk, and the more satisfying every step forward becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/768411dd42c3f598fcb8e67828c74df2.poster.avif?t=1776602236\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/768411dd42c3f598fcb8e67828c74df2.webm?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/768411dd42c3f598fcb8e67828c74df2.mp4?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake has consequences. One wrong move can undo minutes — or even hours — of progress. There are no checkpoints to save you, no shortcuts to the top. All you have is your skill, your timing, and your determination to reach the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/6e26bce25fe96fbcb2261d9858fef5b6.poster.avif?t=1776602236\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/6e26bce25fe96fbcb2261d9858fef5b6.webm?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978460/extras/6e26bce25fe96fbcb2261d9858fef5b6.mp4?t=1776602236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Single-Player Parkour</strong> – A true test of patience, reflexes, and consistency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Beginning</strong> – Start your climb in a frozen, icy environment that sets the tone for the journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> – Progress from snowy landscapes into massive skyscrapers and tricky city structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Gameplay</strong> – Every fall sends you back to the beginning, making every move intense and meaningful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Journey</strong> – Feel the shift from cold silence to dizzying heights as you climb higher and higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> – Each attempt teaches you new paths, tricks, and strategies to climb faster and further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the summit, or will the climb defeat you?</p>",
